<title>USA: All-comm names Jeremy Barbera as COO.</title>
<headline>All-comm names Jeremy Barbera as COO.</headline>
<dateline>CULVER CITY, Calif. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>All-Comm Media Corp said Thursday that Jeremy Barbera has been named president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He succeeds E. William Savage, who will remain with the company as executive vice president and treasurer.</p>
<p>Barbera is currently president and chief executive officer of Metro Services Group Inc, a unit of All-Comm.</p>
